# LSan suppressions for CarCalc — filter known-benign library leaks.
# Run with: LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=lsan.supp ./prog
# (silence leak checks entirely with: ASAN_OPTIONS=detect_leaks=0 ./prog)
#
# Note: FLTK is statically linked into the binary, so its frames appear under
# the program's name and "leak:fltk" does not match them. The actual leaks it
# causes all originate in the X11 font stack below, so those are suppressed.
leak:fltk
leak:sqlite3
leak:libfontconfig
leak:libXft
leak:libX11
leak:libexpat
